<title>UK: Three Brent dates kept, another in dispute.</title>
<headline>Three Brent dates kept, another in dispute.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Brent dates nominated to the paper chains on Friday were kept, with another in dispute, traders said.</p>
<p>BP kept a Brent cargo loading Nov 16-18, and another loading Nov 18-20. Morgan Stanley kept a 17-19 loader, while another with the same dates was reported to be in dispute between BP and Phibro.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
